# ============================================================
# PIPELINE EXECUTION ENGINE — SUPPORT DOCUMENT
# ============================================================
# This engine executes multi-step pipelines. Each pipeline is a
# deterministic sequence of tasks executed in order.
#
# RESPONSIBILITIES:
#   - Register pipelines
#   - Execute steps sequentially
#   - Track pipeline history
#
# Used by:
#   - Orchestrator
#   - Logistics Layer
